[{"title":"友山李道士抱琴来为予作三曲请诗各为之操 九皋","author":"姚勉","text":"青山郁兮白雪深，四无人声兮鹤鸣在阴。\n声闻于天兮而有遐心。\n吁嗟乎，有美一人兮无密尔林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34321,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠谈命韩东野","author":"许月卿","text":"时来风送滕王阁，运去雷轰荐福碑。\n莫道去年曾算了，从知祸福逐年移。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34322,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义简禅人画圆相请赞","author":"释普宁","text":"圆同太虚，无欠无馀。\n良由取舍，所以不如。\n恁么说话，早是起模画样了。\n殊不知才拟任么，便不任么。\n更问如何若何，笑倒嵩山破灶堕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34323,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽陈东湖先生 其二","author":"张衡","text":"乱世没吾宁，何须满百龄。\n云封灵寿杖，天殒少微星。\n长夜泉台黑，幽林鬼火青。\n西风吹木叶，无语慰飘零。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34324,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观参寥手书","author":"区仕衡","text":"雕飞鸷举百篇诗，谁是浮屠妙总师。\n若把贯休齐己论，风流惟有大苏知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34325,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和张无垢胡澹庵二先生清江亭记 其二","author":"刘黻","text":"丙子复丙辰，居然百载下。\n青山招我来，寒燠任更谢。\n寤寐古人心，处变亦如暇。\n纷纷艳孔张，翕翕啧贾马。\n世道长江流，何人屹中夏。\n漆室空兴嗟，且酌宜城斝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34326,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古兴和饶云峰韵 其二","author":"刘黻","text":"贱妾命犹纸，青灯傍低墙。\n群艳逞春娇，半叶难言芳。\n手织补天线，五色生辉光。\n主家不顾盼，内美谁铺张。\n妾命痛在身，病痞非病狂。\n滴滴肝胃泣，奚暇宫样妆。\n层阴阁深燠，雨露胶雪霜。\n犹记承恩时，曾不一饷忘。\n忠劝勿饮酒，□恕乃溢觞。\n妾心谅安往，勿饮君寿长。\n渠知沧海深，难以升斗量。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34327,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百零二首 其一○三","author":"释绍昙","text":"秋晚台星照命宫，不亨通事亦亨通。\n持还赵国连城璧，换我萝窗一枕风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34328,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百零四首 其十五","author":"释绍昙","text":"东篱菊染黄，秋浦茱凝翠。\n古佛放光明，助发实相义。\n渊明有眼无筋，错认白衣人至。\n金风剪剪，玉露团团。\n故人知此意，笑拍玉阑干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34329,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百零四首 其三十","author":"释绍昙","text":"咸淳更号，立见升平。\n两朝圣化，四海欢声。\n乳窦家贫开宴，用度非轻。\n锦云山瀑帽，珠雪瀑悬缨。\n步步寒花翠结，关关幽鸟琴清。\n排当不知因底事，大众万福，庆贺元正。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34330,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百零四首 其五十","author":"释绍昙","text":"百二十日夏，今朝始发头。\n饭抄云子白，羹煮菜香浮。\n未问寒山子，先看水牯牛。\n山前千顷地，信脚踏翻休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34331,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百零四首 其六十一","author":"释绍昙","text":"社燕催归，宾鸿欲返。\n雪点白蘋洲，锦铺红蓼岸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34332,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百零四首 其一○六","author":"释绍昙","text":"千丈悬崖弄险巇，草鞋修整已多时。\n秋风偿尽皮毛债，散步闲云快活戏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34333,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百一十七首 其五十六","author":"释绍昙","text":"大悲正眼露堂堂，百步当摇闪电光。\n被掣风颠医瞎子，暗中拖拽下禅床。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34334,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百一十七首 其七十二","author":"释绍昙","text":"三月青春弹指过，九旬朱夏又从头。\n茶抽雀舌郎忙摘，麦弄虾须逐旋收。\n炽然说法，声撼林丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34335,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂一百一十七首 其七十五","author":"释绍昙","text":"放下著，莫妄想。\n无孔铁锤，半斤八两。\n面门抛掷，土旷人稀。\n无业赵州元不会，凤林徒自说吒之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34336,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂十九首 其九","author":"释绍昙","text":"万法是心光，诸缘惟性晓。\n本无迷悟人，祇要今日了。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34337,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古五十五首 其二十一","author":"释绍昙","text":"云鬓慵梳劣性多，逢人专要逞岝崿。\n门前落节归誇俊，不柰爷爷咬齿何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34338,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古樵","author":"释绍昙","text":"七佛已前曾卖弄，分明一块烂枯柴。\n老卢不解担当得，火种只今无地埋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34339,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自得","author":"释绍昙","text":"宝山有宝费搜寻，何似形山宝最亲。\n左右逢原好收取，丝毫全不假他人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34340,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为叔向题坐禅虾蟆","author":"释绍昙","text":"一从识得性分明，懒作春池鼓吹声。\n闲把六根门锁断，白莲香散水风清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34341,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游九峰 其二","author":"释绍昙","text":"双涧奔流战玉龙，浮屠云锁翠千重。\n只将一疏传天下，大觉驴年识九峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34342,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"布袋赞","author":"释绍昙","text":"握藤枝，驮布袋。\n转脑回头，使些奉化。\n逢人谩说觅文钱，乞儿乞儿，败缺了也。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34343,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天台三圣图赞","author":"释绍昙","text":"满地埃尘弗扫除，无端商校泼文书。\n灼然拄杖能行令，不到丰干放过渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34344,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"丹阳作","author":"陈存","text":"暂入新丰市，犹闻旧酒香。\n抱琴沽一醉，尽日卧垂杨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34345,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"仙棋石","author":"程元岳","text":"传闻棋不在中峰，曾有樵夫得一逢。\n自后世人无处觅，云溪花洞几重重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34346,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"坐对兰菊有樵人献石轮囷如云亦铁中铮铮也喜而成咏","author":"舒岳祥","text":"老入远公社，闲披贝叶文。\n移梅兼得月，买石看生云。\n潭净知鱼数，烟青别鹭群。\n平生有香癖，兰菊胜炉薰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34347,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪后喜晴和正仲近诗 其二","author":"舒岳祥","text":"云开青镜晓，病起白头人。\n阳洞林光动，晴檐鸟语真。\n黄花修故事，新酒接比邻。\n火急输官米，寒舂连夜频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34348,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和用之题剡雪 其一","author":"舒岳祥","text":"鲈鱼未上夜潮回，吹笛蓬窗古岸隈。\n谁遣戴公山上住，两回牵帅子猷来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34349,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"去春达善分碧桃移植篆畦今春已作蕊达善前有见过之约偶立花下口占寄之 其二","author":"舒岳祥","text":"前年花在玉堂日，偶和成编竞出奇。\n今日篆畦同寂寞，碧桃无语我无诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34350,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道间语 其一","author":"张埴","text":"往往骑驴走一遭，江南何处识田毛。\n几人叹息秋风里，要到天河手不高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34351,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道间语 其二","author":"张埴","text":"蹋破鸡头要作家，豚蹄不直谓污邪。\n火轮杀尽人间物，输乞淮南觳?车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34352,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"远游","author":"陈必复","text":"关山劳眺望，宇宙忆经行。\n地隔南溟断，天低北斗横。\n高谯闻远柝，孤枕历寒更。\n只影惟堪吊，殊乡鲜弟兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34353,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"李申子","text":"深城市红尘怎得侵，骨云岩桧老险惊。\n兴废一掬清泉酌，沈寂徘徊觅句听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34354,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵方万里雨夜雪意","author":"赵与东","text":"芋火房阴处，翛然类懒残。\n雨欺梅影瘦，风助竹声寒。\n拥袂衣全薄，哦诗字欲安。\n儿童疑有雪，频起穴窗看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34355,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幸侍轺车敬赘严韵 其一","author":"赵与㒇","text":"男儿有志事竟成，好把功名竹帛垂。\n今日舆图当混一，谁能重拭□□碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34356,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幸侍轺车敬赘严韵 其二","author":"赵与㒇","text":"细把中兴唐颂看，玉环遗恨记当年。\n自从拥马回灵武，整顿乾坤岂偶然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34357,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"用洁堂韵赠徐清溪祷雨","author":"马廷鸾","text":"怒起乖龙变蛰雷，神翁此手更神哉。\n老天于物何尝病，旧雨如人自不来。\n彼稷之苗馀滞穗，我行其野绝纤埃。\n方平狡狯犹馀事，聊慰饥农取大咍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34358,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽许秋浦 其一","author":"马廷鸾","text":"纷纷顶板尽圈红，伯仲高鶱槐市风。\n一第不酬攀桂客，千年祇泣感麟翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34359,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题三首 其一","author":"马廷鸾","text":"大地生灵惜暵乾，纸田不饱腐儒餐。\n闲将博士齑盐味，试上先生苜蓿盘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34360,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题三首 其二","author":"马廷鸾","text":"口语甘时心独异，中边甜处味方宜。\n诗情合荐东坡老，惭愧当年蜜荔枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34361,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题三首 其三","author":"马廷鸾","text":"闻说江边起柁楼，欲将吾道付沧洲。\n三年恶瞰卢仝屋，一日轻装范蠡舟。\n蹈海高怀欣独往，济川好手蹇难留。\n樯阴舸下能容我，雨笠烟蓑傲白鸥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34362,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽故知容州朝请舅 其二","author":"樊梦辰","text":"利欲嗟澜倒，沈沦几缙绅。\n颓波障流俗，砥柱赖斯人。\n高节标时望，清风濯世尘。\n圣朝公史笔，卓行传名臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34363,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遁溪","author":"释行海","text":"白石矶头鹭一丛，隔烟何处夕阳钟。\n青山两岸人家少，不种桃花只种松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34364,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲居 其三","author":"释行海","text":"山矾香气近幽荪，玉色桃花静对门。\n晓日照烟林坞湿，春云过雨石池浑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34365,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赋古岩","author":"释行海","text":"撑空乱石带云霞，灵树曾开几劫花。\n人在玲珑深处坐，疏疏泉点滴袈裟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34366,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"孙内翰","text":"那更廉织雨，谩道玉为堂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34367,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"谢翱","text":"秋风飒以至，今日重阳日。\n眼明对南山，尚想陶彭泽。\n向来建威幕，颇见有此客。\n驱车不小留，驾言公田秫。\n一朝又弃去，此意谁能识。\n寄奴趣殊礼，风旨来自北。\n只今王江州，建国功第一。\n故是何珉孙，举动良足惜。\n饮愧望柴桑，稍以自湔涤。\n殷勤白衣饷，犹恐不我即。\n中路候蓝舆，要致已甚迫。\n葛巾赤两脚，颓然向林宅。\n此翁本坦荡，焉能苦违物。\n虽然可计取，中实未易屈。\n华轩又何羡，自载返蓬荜。\n终身书甲子，往往义形色。\n如使磷与缁，安得为玉雪。\n篱边菊弄黄，粲粲正堪摘。\n我方持空觞，千载高风激。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34368,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登西楼怀汤损之","author":"陈允平","text":"杨柳飘飘春思长，绿桥流水绕官墙。\n碧云望断空回首，一半阑干无夕阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34369,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕书怀","author":"何应龙","text":"去岁有灯仍有月，今年无月亦无灯。\n谁知此夕吟怀里，看尽寒梅一涧冰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34370,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖为陈世崇饯行","author":"壑大","text":"我昔见君方成童，长吉才华惊钜公。\n人间科第不屑就，直使声名闻九重。\n乃翁引上凝华殿，子虚不待他人荐。\n入直承明凡几年，天上奇书尽曾见。\n翩然归去大江西，二疏父子还相随。\n故乡分得云水地，却喜不爽渔樵期。\n春雨骑牛对烟草，何如振衣随龙五云表。\n秋霜黄独煨地炉，何如驼峰犀箸食天厨。\n林间食叶抄诗句，何如宫妃捧砚挥毫处。\n溪边照影著荷衣，何如龙门应制夺锦时。\n钧天梦断难回顾，浩然合在山中住。\n金石台前伴白云，六年不踏西湖路。\n今日重来发长吁，忍看清平破草庐。\n尽拈书籍向人卖，归买田园供荷锄。\n乃翁八十齿发落，倚门待儿斜日薄。\n孤山梅花带不归，却唤扁舟载童鹤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34371,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠陈随隐归游江西","author":"张彝","text":"酝藉中涵廊庙姿，诗文都好见宸批。\n只蒙四字君王宠，虮虱微臣不用题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34372,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郁罗箫台","author":"王洧","text":"洞霄尽有游人到，罕有冲寒冒雪来。\n清晓步虚钟磬响，玉山扶出郁罗台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34373,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"楼楚材","text":"看来固是最低树，外此都无许大花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34374,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"楼楚材","text":"秋香无比魁天下，仙种非凡□月中。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34375,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"楼楚材","text":"满阎浮世香俱有，与广寒宫花对开。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34376,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"楼楚材","text":"春将结尾去时有，花在着身高处香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34377,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"楼楚材","text":"晴霄有月与佳色，春圃无花可比香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34378,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"楼楚材","text":"房生里面子虚实，柄折中间丝短长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34379,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"楼楚材","text":"从来把得坚牢处，不是晴明不肯飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34380,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"楼楚材","text":"名园不是无花卉，凌驾春风不似伊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34381,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"楼楚材","text":"一株种外无遗种，九个花间有细花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34382,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"楼楚材","text":"混融月色江湖夜，照应芦花岛屿秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34383,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"楼楚材","text":"晚归烟树住犹见，晓向雪汀飞若无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34384,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十二","author":"楼楚材","text":"蝶成擒处身粘粉，花蹈翻时足带香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34385,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十三","author":"楼楚材","text":"野花狼藉桑麻长，除却他边补这边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34386,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十四","author":"楼楚材","text":"吞毡固是真难事，要辨人生是与非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34387,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十五","author":"楼楚材","text":"有时移向西堂去，一座青山逐手来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34388,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十六","author":"楼楚材","text":"玲珑不许多呈露，只借时人一面看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34389,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十八","author":"楼楚材","text":"小心抽出大规模。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34390,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十九","author":"楼楚材","text":"除屏簇外少青山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34391,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十","author":"楼楚材","text":"矮婆娑地却禁霜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34392,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十一","author":"楼楚材","text":"又欲其生树上苔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34393,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十二","author":"楼楚材","text":"器量不争正二月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34394,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十三","author":"楼楚材","text":"云掌月阴晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":34395,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]